Spec: Asynchronous Android stream client

Purpose:
  Attach a previously opened authorized operation and return a standard socket to independent applications.

Owns:
  ./StreamClient.java

Must:
  Use the signature-pinned client for attachment, retain original operation identity and never retry open or business bytes.
  Bound worker admission, descriptor handshakes and timers; close late sockets after cancellation.
  Adapt a formal retained stream reference through the appended Binder transaction without reusing the experimental operation namespace.
